  "bio": "Léa Lebeuf is a talented tattoo artist based in Carouge, Switzerland, specializing in sketch, dotwork, and fineline styles. She works at LaCabane studio in Geneva, demonstrating an unparalleled skill level that shines through in each intricate piece she creates. Her work showcases precise lines, careful dotwork, and creative sketches that are as unique as her clients.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Carouge, Geneva, Switzerland\n\nWork at @lacabane.tattooshop \nGeneva, Switzerland\nBooking  - March- April opens\nJuly —>5 months on the road TBA 🏴‍☠️🇨🇭🇫🇷🇪🇸🇵🇹…🏴‍☠️\nContact@lebeuf.ch",
